# the Sound page (the palette, the pulse sound, its chance): SEQ twice, the knobs, saved and carried through a reboot,
# and the garden still plays with the palette up and the melodic pulse on (nothing clipping, nothing silent)
wait 300
tap SEQ
expect view 4
tap SEQ
expect view 5
wait 100
shot sound.png
expect par28 0
expect par29 0
expect par30 100
turn K2 1
expect par29 1
turn K1 100 20
expect par28 100
turn K3 -30 100
expect par30 70
shot sound_on.png
# the Pulse page is one step left of it, Space one step right
turn SELECT -1 100
expect view 4
turn SELECT 2 100
expect view 6
tap SEQ
expect view 4
tap SEQ
expect view 5
# a quiet minute with it all on
wav sound.wav
tap PLAY
tap PLAY
wait 20000
expect playing 1
expect sixteenths >40
wavstop
expect peak_db_max -0.5
expect peak_db_min -35
expect midi_out >0
# kept with the piece, through a save and a reboot
tap SAVE
reboot
wait 300
expect par28 100
expect par29 1
expect par30 70
# another piece keeps its own, and the defaults for a piece not touched
turn PRESET 1
expect par28 0
expect par29 0
expect par30 100
turn PRESET -1
expect par28 100
expect par29 1
